{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1472980-dragon-draconic-form-clarification","id":1472980,"title":"[Dragon] Draconic Form clarification","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-01-21T10:29:20-08:00","id":1472980,"title":"[Dragon] Draconic Form clarification","content":"Does the draconic form truly give +1 Scale to all actions or only +1 Scale to Size and Strength related actions? It hard to tell due to the wording of the following:<br /> <br /> &quot;By default, with no Transformation Knacks, this form significantly increases the character\u2019s size and strength. The Heir gains +1 Scale on all actions,...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25683-tekknowkub","name":"tekknowkub","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25683_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-21T17:21:01-08:00","id":1473004,"title":"","content":"<i>Should</i> if give Scale +1 to anything besides size and strength? If so, why?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-28T23:58:40-08:00","id":1473517,"title":"","content":"Going by how scale is normally used in Storypath, it's shorthand for 'any action that being in a dragon form might conceivably help with'. Which is mostly going to be strength and size, but you could make a case that intimidation and the like should enjoy it as well.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2334-aliasi","name":"Aliasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2334_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"197"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-07T20:29:26-08:00","id":1474158,"title":"","content":"It probably gives +1 Scale to make dragon form a valuable tool to all characters rather than just the big strong scary dragons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-08T04:01:59-08:00","id":1474184,"title":"","content":"I think the way Scion deals with Scale may make the dragon form very flexible, but in the end its up to t